ception.'}, {'input': [{'parameter': 'strategy', 'value': 'MockStrategyAlwaysEnterExit'}, {'parameter': 'tradeType', 'value': 'TradeType.SELL'}, {'parameter': 'amount', 'value': 'null'}], 'expected': 'NullPointerException or IllegalArgumentException', 'description': 'A null amount must be rejected with an exception.'}]}, {'group': 'Edge cases with BarSeries bounds', 'cases': [{'input': [{'parameter': 'strategy', 'value': 'MockStrategyAlwaysEnterExit'}, {'parameter': 'tradeType', 'value': 'TradeType.BUY'}, {'parameter': 'amount', 'value': 'Num.valueOf(100)'}], 'expected': 'TradingRecord with zero trades (empty record)', 'description': 'If the underlying BarSeries is empty (beginIndex > endIndex), the manager should return an empty TradingRecord without throwing.'}, {'input': [{'parameter': 'strategy', 'value': 'MockStrategyEnterAtLastBar'}, {'parameter': 'tradeType', 'value': 'TradeType.SELL'}, {'parameter': 'amount', 'value': 'Num.valueOf(200)'}], 'expected': 'TradingRecord with a single trade opened at the last bar and closed immediately (if exit condition is also true)', 'description': 'When the start and finish indices are the same (single‑bar series), the method must still evaluate the strategy for that bar and produce the appropriate trade(s).'}]}, {'group': 'Negative amount handling', 'cases': [{'input': [{'parameter': 'strategy', 'value': 'MockStrategyAlwaysEnterExit'}, {'parameter': 'tradeType', 'value': 'TradeType.BUY'}, {'parameter': 'amount', 'value': 'Num.valueOf(-100)'}], 'expected': 'IllegalArgumentException (amount must be >= 0)', 'description': 'A negative amount is not a valid investment size; the manager should reject the call with an IllegalArgumentException.'}]}, {'group': 'Strategy runtime exception propagation', 'cases': [{'input': [{'parameter': 'strategy', 'value': 'MockStrategyThrowsOnFirstCall'}, {'parameter': 'tradeType', 'value': 'TradeType.BUY'}, {'parameter': 'amount', 'value': 'Num.valueOf(1000)'}], 'expected': 'RuntimeException propagated from strategy', 'description': 'If the supplied strategy throws an unchecked exception while being evaluated, the run method must not swallow it; the exception should propagate to the caller.'}]}, {'group': 'Multiple sequential trades', 'cases': [{'input': [{'parameter': 'strategy', 'value': 'MockStrategyEnterExitMultipleTimes'}, {'parameter': 'tradeType', 'value': 'TradeType.BUY'}, {'parameter': 'amount', 'value': 'Num.valueOf(500)'}], 'expected': 'TradingRecord containing exactly 2 trades: first from index 0 to 2, second from index 3 to 5', 'description': 'A strategy that signals entry at bar 0, exit at bar 2, re‑entry at bar 3 and exit at bar 5 should produce a TradingRecord with two distinct trades covering those index ranges.'}]}, {'group': 'Non‑zero start index series', 'cases': [{'input': [{'parameter': 'strategy', 'value': 'MockStrategyAlwaysEnterExit'}, {'parameter': 'tradeType', 'value': 'TradeType.SELL'}, {'parameter': 'amount', 'value': 'Num.valueOf(250)'}], 'expected': "TradingRecord containing trades only for bars with index 5‑10 (the series' beginIndex‑endIndex)", 'description': 'When the underlying BarSeries is constructed so that getBeginIndex() returns 5 and getEndIndex() returns 10, the run method must evaluate the strategy only on that window and produce trades limited to those indices.'}]}, {'group': 'TradeType mismatch – strategy signals opposite direction', 'cases': [{'input': [{'parameter': 'strategy', 'value': 'MockStrategyAlwaysSell'}, {'parameter': 'tradeType', 'value': 'TradeType.BUY'}, {'parameter': 'amount', 'value': 'Num.valueOf(300)'}], 'expected': 'TradingRecord with zero trades (empty record)', 'description': 'If the strategy only generates SELL signals but the caller restricts the run to BUY trades, the manager should ignore those signals and return an empty TradingRecord.'}]}, {'group': 'Custom transaction cost model effect', 'cases': [{'input': [{'parameter': 'strategy', 'value': 'MockStrategyAlwaysEnterExit'}, {'parameter':